<?php if($path==='/legal/privacy'): ?><h2>Forum and project publishing</h2><p>Forum questions, replies, author usernames, and posting times are public. Signed-in users may delete their own questions and replies; the administrator may moderate discussions and block or delete accounts. Account deletion anonymizes existing contributions. Project files uploaded by the administrator become publicly downloadable only when the project is published. GitHub project import requests public repository metadata from GitHub; website visitors are not signed in to GitHub by this integration.</p><?php endif ?>
